THE READY-MADE TEMPLATES · القوالب الجاهزة — E.B.E, powered by E-VIAS, 2026

The six templates in this folder (DANA · DHIL · JAMR · NASEEJ · VEYRE · COALYARD) are FREE for the
community to use, copy, change and adapt — for your own business, a client's, or to learn from.
No permission to ask and no payment. They are the templates promised in the "Design" reels and
come with the PDF "Design System · the Skills" (https://selv4.com/a/79stmzbvyj).

All six are imaginary businesses made for the challenge: take the approach, not the words or the pictures.

What this licence does NOT cover: the factory these sites were built with (the E.B.E Design System kit —
its modules, its inspector, its gates and its engines) is separate, is not in this folder, and keeps
its own licence.

Third-party code inside the files: DANA.html and DHIL.html bundle three.js
(Copyright 2010-2025 Three.js Authors, MIT licence — its notice is kept inside each file).

The files are given as they are, with no warranty.
